concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sec-3-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedules"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3-2 ;
    values:originalText "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  Definition of “competition”  Schedule 1  No. 114, 2017 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review) Act 2017" ;
