concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-1-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Subsection 4(1) (definition of competition)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: competition includes:  (a) competition from goods that are, or are capable of being, imported into Australia; and  (b) competition from services that are rendered, or are capable of being rendered, in Australia by persons not resident or not carrying on business in Australia.  Schedule 2  Cartels" ;
