    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (a) the cartel provision is:  (i) for the purposes of a joint venture; and  (ii) reasonably necessary for undertaking the joint venture; and  (b) the joint venture is for any one or more of the following:  (i) production of goods;  (ii) supply of goods or services;  (iii) acquisition of goods or services; and  (ba) the joint venture is not carried on for the purpose of substantially lessening competition; and" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer .

