    values:originalText "Omit all the words from and including “(6) The” to and including “by way of:”, substitute:  (6) This section does not apply to or in relation to the giving effect to a provision of a contract, arrangement or understanding, or to or in relation to engaging in a concerted practice, by way of:  Schedule 3  Price signalling and concerted practices" ;
    skos:definition "Omit all the words from and including “(6) The” to and including “by way of:”, substitute:  (6) This section does not apply to or in relation to the giving effect to a provision of a contract, arrangement or understanding, or to or in relation to engaging in a concerted practice, by way of:  Schedule 3  Price signalling and concerted practices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "291ac83fe578d83806342efc168cb83e02c52fecf1d37505dcd3498dd6ef665f" ;
