    values:originalText "Insert:  (2AA) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(g), the particulars to be given to the Commission:  (a) need not include particulars of prices for the goods or services; but  (b) must include particulars of any method of fixing, controlling or maintaining such prices." ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer .

