concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-3-sec-36 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36 After subsection 51(2) of Schedule 1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-36 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (2AA) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(g), the particulars to be given to the Commission:  (a) need not include particulars of prices for the goods or services; but  (b) must include particulars of any method of fixing, controlling or maintaining such prices." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (2AA) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(g), the particulars to be given to the Commission:  (a) need not include particulars of prices for the goods or services; but  (b) must include particulars of any method of fixing, controlling or maintaining such prices."@en ;
