    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-88-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commission may specify conditions in the authorisation. Subsection (2) does not apply if any of the conditions are not complied with.  Authorisations, notifications and class exemptions  Schedule 9 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 114, 2017 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review) Act 2017" ;
