concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-88-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "88(4) Commission may grant authorisations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-88-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Without limiting subsection (3), the Commission may grant a merger authorisation on the condition that a person must give, and comply with, an undertaking to the Commission under section 87B. Single authorisation may deal with several types of conduct" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Without limiting subsection (3), the Commission may grant a merger authorisation on the condition that a person must give, and comply with, an undertaking to the Commission under section 87B. Single authorisation may deal with several types of conduct"@en ;
