concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-88-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "88(6) Commission may grant authorisations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-88-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The Commission does not have power to grant an authorisation for conduct engaged in before the Commission decides the application for the authorisation. Withdrawing an application" ;
