    values:originalText "(5) While the determination remains in force, but subject to section 95AB and any limitations specified under subsection (2),  Authorisations, notifications and class exemptions  Schedule 9 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 114, 2017 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review) Act 2017  the provisions of Part IV specified in the determination do not apply in relation to conduct of the kind specified in the determination." ;
