doc:sch-9-sec-26-ss-5d a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26(5D) After subsection 102(5C)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5D) Upon a review of the giving of a notice by the Commission under subsection 93ACA(1):  (a) if the person who applied for the review satisfies the Tribunal that:  (i) apart from section 93ACA, the Commission would not have had grounds referred to in subparagraph 93ACA(1)(b)(i); or  (ii) compliance with the conditions imposed by the notice would not ensure those grounds would not exist;  the Tribunal must make a determination setting aside the notice; or  (b) if the person who applied for the review does not so satisfy the Tribunal—the Tribunal must make a determination affirming the notice." ;
    cof:pageNumber "55"^^xsd:integer .

