    cof:title "71A(1) Issue of spectrum licence taken to be an acquisition of an asset" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of the provisions of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 mentioned in subsection (2), the issue of a spectrum licence to a person is taken to be:  (a) an acquisition by the person of an asset of another person; and  (b) conduct engaged in by the person." ;
