concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-106a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "106A Issue of apparatus licence taken to be an acquisition of an"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-106a ;
    values:originalText "asset and conduct  (1) For the purposes of the provisions of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 mentioned in subsection (2), the issue of an apparatus licence to a person is taken to be:  (a) an acquisition by the person of an asset of another person; and  (b) conduct engaged in by the person.  (2) The provisions of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 are:  (a) section 50 and subsection 81(1); and  (b) Parts VII and IX, to the extent that those provisions relate to section 50 of that Act.  (3) Subsection (1) does not apply to a transmitter licence issued under section 102 or to an NBS transmitter licence.  (4) Subsection (1) does not apply to the issue of an apparatus licence if the licence is issued under Division 7 by way of renewal of an existing apparatus licence." ;
    skos:definition "asset and conduct  (1) For the purposes of the provisions of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 mentioned in subsection (2), the issue of an apparatus licence to a person is taken to be:  (a) an acquisition by the person of an asset of another person; and  (b) conduct engaged in by the person.  (2) The provisions of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 are:  (a) section 50 and subsection 81(1); and  (b) Parts VII and IX, to the extent that those provisions relate to section 50 of that Act.  (3) Subsection (1) does not apply to a transmitter licence issued under section 102 or to an NBS transmitter licence.  (4) Subsection (1) does not apply to the issue of an apparatus licence if the licence is issued under Division 7 by way of renewal of an existing apparatus licence."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8062d09a512866640dd2e7c65ab1f75710e7b13f70112470aafcd3860a9aa051" ;
    cof:pageNumber "79"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-106a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-106a-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-106a-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-106a-ss-4 ;
