doc:sch-11-sec-3-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3(6) After subsection 155(5A)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of (but without limiting) paragraph (5B)(b), a determination of whether a search is reasonable may take into account the following:  (a) the nature and complexity of the matter to which the notice relates;  (b) the number of documents involved;  (c) the ease and cost of retrieving a document relative to the resources of the person who was given the notice;  (d) any other relevant matter." ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer .

