concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-19-norm a values:Undertaking ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-19 ;
