doc:sch-12-sec-20-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20(1) After Subdivision C of Division 2A of Part IIIA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a decision of the Commonwealth Minister is in force under section 44N (including as a result of an extension under section 44NB) that a regime established by a State or Territory for access to a service is an effective access regime, the Council:  (a) may, on its own initiative; and  (b) must, on an application made under subsection (3); consider whether to recommend that the Commonwealth Minister revoke the decision." ;
    cof:pageNumber "90"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20(2) After Subdivision C of Division 2A of Part IIIA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-12-sec-20-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Before considering on its own initiative whether to recommend that the Commonwealth Minister revoke the decision, the Council must:  (a) publish, by electronic or other means, a notice to that effect; and  (b) give a copy of the notice to:  (i) the responsible Minister for the State or Territory; and  (ii) the provider of the service." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Before considering on its own initiative whether to recommend that the Commonwealth Minister revoke the decision, the Council must:  (a) publish, by electronic or other means, a notice to that effect; and  (b) give a copy of the notice to:  (i) the responsible Minister for the State or Territory; and  (ii) the provider of the service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eba0728805471185c6821492a9c97aeaccb03fe8c9ebe41ddbec0d91cb0c9d7c" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20 ;
    cof:pageNumber "90"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Council must give a copy of the notice to certain persons. Publish a notice and provide it to certain parties before considering revoking a decision." ;
    dc:description "Notice" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
