doc:sch-12-sec-20-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20(4) After Subdivision C of Division 2A of Part IIIA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) Subject to subsection (5), the Council’s consideration of whether to make the recommendation must be in accordance with subsection 44M(4)." ;
