concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20(7) After Subdivision C of Division 2A of Part IIIA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-12-sec-20-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If the Council is not so satisfied, the Council must, in writing, recommend to the Commonwealth Minister that he or she not revoke the decision. Note 1: There are time limits that apply to the Council’s recommendation: see section 44NC. Note 2: The Council may request information and invite public submissions: see sections 44NBB and 44NE. Note 3: The Council must publish its recommendation: see section 44NF. 44NBB  Council may request information" ;
    skos:definition "(7) If the Council is not so satisfied, the Council must, in writing, recommend to the Commonwealth Minister that he or she not revoke the decision. Note 1: There are time limits that apply to the Council’s recommendation: see section 44NC. Note 2: The Council may request information and invite public submissions: see sections 44NBB and 44NE. Note 3: The Council must publish its recommendation: see section 44NF. 44NBB  Council may request information"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "25affa23029aa120daab7bcfa0849abb092518bcf084bb315e3fa8d33d06487e" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20 ;
